return ['domain'=>NULL,'plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'zh_TW','project-id-version'=>'Babilim 1.2.1','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-09T07:54:43+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-09T07:54:43+00:00','x-generator'=>'Babilim','messages'=>['Sent when you press Enable Babilim, and again if the site has to register anew: your site\'s URL, the WordPress, PHP and Babilim versions, the language of your site and the languages in use on it, and a public key generated for this site.'=>'在您按下「啟用 Babilim」時傳送，若網站需要重新註冊時也會再次傳送：您網站的 URL、WordPress、PHP 與 Babilim 版本、您網站的語言與網站上使用中的語言，以及為此網站產生的公開金鑰。','Sent on every check: the list of installed plugins and themes with the state of any Babilim translation installed for them, the languages in use, and short diagnostic codes.'=>'每次檢查時傳送：已安裝的外掛與佈景主題清單，以及為它們安裝的各項 Babilim 翻譯的狀態、使用中的語言，以及簡短的診斷代碼。','Every request includes your site\'s URL, and the site\'s access token is included whenever the service needs it.'=>'每個請求都會包含您網站的 URL，並在服務需要時附上網站的 access token。','What Babilim sends to the service'=>'Babilim 傳送給服務的資料','Your site\'s URL'=>'您網站的 URL','WordPress version'=>'WordPress 版本','PHP version'=>'PHP 版本','Babilim version'=>'Babilim 版本','Your site\'s language'=>'您網站的語言','Languages in use on your site'=>'您網站上使用中的語言','A public key for this site'=>'此網站的公開金鑰','A public key generated for this site, used to prove requests genuinely come from this site. Only the public half is ever sent; the private half stays on your site.'=>'為此網站產生的公開金鑰，用來證明請求確實來自此網站。只會傳送公開的部分；私密的部分會留在您的網站上。','Installed plugins and themes'=>'已安裝的外掛與佈景主題','For every installed plugin and theme: its name (slug), version, text domain, whether it is listed on WordPress.org, and the languages it already includes. For each Babilim translation you have installed: which version it is, when it was last checked, and whether it passed its file check.'=>'每個已安裝的外掛與佈景主題：其名稱（slug）、版本、text domain、是否列於 WordPress.org，以及已內建的語言。對於您已安裝的每個 Babilim 翻譯：其版本、上次檢查的時間，以及是否通過檔案檢查。','Source files (only if you confirm an upload)'=>'來源檔案（僅在您確認上傳時）','Diagnostic codes'=>'診斷代碼','Up to 20 short diagnostic codes (for example, a translation file that failed its check), each with the plugin or theme, the language and the time it happened. They never contain any text from your site or any translated text.'=>'最多 20 個簡短的診斷代碼（例如未通過檢查的翻譯檔案），每個都附有外掛或佈景主題、語言以及發生的時間。這些代碼絕不包含您網站上的任何文字或任何已翻譯的文字。','%1$d site on this network is set to erase its Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to that site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %2$s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in that site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'此網路中有 %1$d 個網站設定為在刪除外掛時清除其 Babilim 識別資訊。之後將無法自動還原綁定在這些網站的付費授權，您必須聯絡 Babilim 支援（%2$s）。若要保留識別資訊，請按「取消」，在各網站的 Babilim 設定中取消勾選「解除安裝時刪除所有 Babilim 資料」，然後再次停用。仍要停用嗎？','%1$s %2$s.'=>'%1$s %2$s。','%1$s (%2$s): %3$s'=>'%1$s（%2$s）：%3$s','%1$s nothing to do.'=>'%1$s無需執行任何動作。','%1$s: %2$s'=>'%1$s：%2$s','%1$s: %2$s (%3$s)'=>'%1$s：%2$s（%3$s）','%1$s: %2$s. Choose the language.'=>'%1$s：%2$s。請選擇語言。','%d failed'=>'%d 個失敗','%d not yet tried'=>'%d 個尚未嘗試','%d report is waiting. "Always share" and "Don\'t share" apply to all of them.'=>'有 %d 則回報正在等候。「一律分享」與「不分享」會套用於所有回報。','%d skipped'=>'%d 個已略過','%d succeeded'=>'%d 個成功','%d to install'=>'%d 個待安裝','(a public key generated for this site)'=>'（為本網站產生的公開金鑰）','(detected)'=>'(已偵測)','(generic codes and coordinates only)'=>'（僅含通用代碼與座標）','A cleanup was paused on %1$s: %2$s. Nothing was deleted.'=>'清理作業已於 %1$s 暫停：%2$s。未刪除任何內容。','A file in the component could not be read, so it was not packaged.'=>'元件中有檔案無法讀取，因此未納入封裝。','A host that serves only one PHP request at a time cannot complete this step.'=>'一次只處理一個 PHP 請求的主機無法完成此步驟。','A part of the upload kept failing, so the upload was cancelled.'=>'上傳的某個部分持續失敗，因此已取消上傳。','A translation cannot be requested for that locale on this site right now.'=>'目前無法在