stration is paused.'=>'Babilim 無法完成此網站的驗證（服務無法回連到此網站）。註冊已暫停。','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed until verification succeeds.'=>'Babilim 無法驗證此網站，在驗證成功之前不會下載或安裝任何內容。','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed.'=>'Babilim 無法驗證此網站，因此不會下載或安裝任何內容。','Babilim gets translations from the Babilim service for the plugins and themes on this site that have none for your language, and installs the ones your service plan covers.'=>'Babilim 會從 Babilim 服務取得本網站上尚無您所用語言翻譯的外掛和佈景主題的翻譯，並安裝您的服務方案所涵蓋的翻譯。','Babilim has not been enabled for this site yet.'=>'此網站尚未啟用 Babilim。','Babilim has not installed any translation for this language.'=>'Babilim 尚未為此語言安裝任何翻譯。','Babilim hit an error. Share an error report?'=>'Babilim 發生錯誤。要分享錯誤回報嗎？','Babilim installed %d translation automatically since your last visit.'=>'自上次造訪以來，Babilim 已自動安裝 %d 個翻譯。','Babilim is disabled. Nothing more is sent; translations already installed keep working.'=>'Babilim 已停用。不會再傳送任何資料；已安裝的翻譯仍可正常運作。','Babilim is enabled: this site is verified and %d component was found.'=>'Babilim 已啟用：本網站已通過驗證，並找到 %d 個元件。','Babilim is enabling and checking this site… (last attempt: %s)'=>'Babilim 正在啟用並檢查此網站…（上次嘗試：%s）','Babilim is enabling and checking this site… Reload this page or wait for the scheduled check to finish.'=>'Babilim 正在啟用並檢查此網站… 請重新載入此頁面，或等待排程檢查完成。','Babilim is not enabled.'=>'Babilim 尚未啟用。','Babilim is set to erase this site\'s identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to this site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in the Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Babilim 已設定為在刪除外掛時清除本網站的識別資訊。之後將無法自動還原綁定在本網站的付費授權，您必須聯絡 Babilim 支援（%s）。若要保留識別資訊，請按「取消」，在 Babilim 設定中取消勾選「解除安裝時刪除所有 Babilim 資料」，然後再次停用。仍要停用嗎？','Babilim ran out of time for this step and will continue on the next check.'=>'B