nloads: %1$d/%2$d (%3$s)'=>'下載次數：%1$d/%2$d（%3$s）','Each component\'s own contribution to each locale\'s shared default-domain supplement.'=>'各元件對每個語系共用的預設文字網域補充翻譯所提供的內容。','Enable Babilim'=>'啟用 Babilim','Enabling…'=>'啟用中…','English (United States)'=>'英文（美國）','Entries'=>'項目','Entry count mismatch for %s'=>'%s 的項目數量不符','Error reports'=>'錯誤回報','Every locale in use on this site (site locale, installed language packs, user locales, and any you add manually). No locale is treated differently from another.'=>'本網站使用中的所有語系（網站語系、已安裝的語言包、使用者語系，以及您手動新增的語系）。不會對任何語系給予差別待遇。','Excluded'=>'已排除','Files with other names or extensions are not included, nor are the uploads, cache, logs, backup, data, vendor, node_modules and languages folders, hidden files, or files whose names match common secrets (wp-config*, .env*, *.sql, *.log, *.pem, *.key). Code files can still contain text or data you would not want to share; check them if you are unsure. The service removes the same kinds of files again on arrival.'=>'其他名稱或副檔名的檔案不會包含在內,uploads、cache、logs、backup、data、vendor、node_modules 與 languages 資料夾、隱藏檔案,以及名稱符合常見機密檔案的檔案(wp-config*、.env*、*.sql、*.log、*.pem、*.key)也不會包含。程式碼檔案仍可能含有您不想分享的文字或資料;如有疑慮,請自行檢查。服務在收到檔案時會再次移除同類檔案。','Fills in missing translations for the plugins and themes already installed on your site.'=>'為您網站上已安裝的外掛與佈景主題補齊缺少的翻譯。','Free'=>'免費','Free-plan slots'=>'免費方案名額','General'=>'一般','If this is on, uninstalling also erases this site\'s identity. The paid license attached to this site cannot be restored automatically afterwards; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s to get it back.'=>'若啟用此選項，解除安裝時也會清除本網站的識別資訊。之後將無法自動還原綁定在本網站的付費授權，您必須聯絡 Babilim 支援（%s）才能取回。','Included'=>'已納入','Included in index'=>'已納入索引','Install available translations automatically'=>'自動安裝可用的翻譯','Installed'=>'已安裝','Installed translations are kept, but no further checks or downloads will run.'=>'已安裝的翻譯會保留，但不會再執行任何檢查或下載。','Installed · %s'=>'已安裝 · %s','Installed · built for %1$s, this site has %2$s'=>'已安裝 · 為 %1$s 