 verify.'=>'沒有待驗證的挑戰。','No plugins or themes found.'=>'找不到外掛或佈景主題。','No previous build to roll back to.'=>'沒有可回滾的先前建置。','No record for %s'=>'找不到 %s 的紀錄','No site id is on file to rotate a token for.'=>'沒有已記錄的網站 ID，無法輪替權杖。','No — component inactive'=>'否 — 元件未啟用','No — component removed'=>'否 — 元件已移除','No — installed version differs from the active one'=>'否 — 已安裝的版本與啟用中的版本不同','Not a valid server_build_id: %s'=>'不是有效的 server_build_id：%s','Not covered by the free service plan'=>'不在免費服務方案涵蓋範圍內','Not installed'=>'未安裝','Not registered yet'=>'尚未註冊','Not supported'=>'不支援','Not verified'=>'未驗證','Note (optional)'=>'備註（選填）','Nothing to choose.'=>'沒有可選擇的項目。','Nothing to confirm.'=>'沒有需要確認的項目。','Off by default: deleting the plugin keeps this site\'s identity, so a reinstall can reuse it.'=>'預設為關閉：刪除外掛會保留此網站的識別資料，以便重新安裝時沿用。','One or more served files no longer match the manifest.'=>'一個或多個已提供的檔案與 manifest 不再相符。','One-time purchase for this site: %1$s %2$s. Includes all future translation updates. Payment is handled by Paddle in a new tab.'=>'此網站一次性購買:%1$s %2$s。包含所有未來的翻譯更新。付款將由 Paddle 在新分頁中處理。','Only a network administrator can do this, because it changes translation files shared by every site on this network.'=>'只有網路管理員可以執行此操作，因為這會變更此網路上所有網站共用的翻譯檔案。','Only plugins and themes can be packaged.'=>'僅能封裝外掛與佈景主題。','Only when you confirm an upload for a plugin or theme that is not on WordPress.org: every .php and .js file, every block.json file, and the readme.txt, readme.md, style.css and theme.json in that component\'s main folder, as a zip, after files that match common secrets are left out.'=>'僅在您確認上傳不在 WordPress.org 上的外掛或佈景主題時：會將所有 .php 與 .js 檔案、所有 block.json 檔案，以及該元件主資料夾中的 readme.txt、readme.md、style.css 與 theme.json，在排除檔名符合常見機密檔案命名模式的檔案後，以 zip 格式上傳。','Open Babilim settings'=>'開啟 Babilim 設定','Original language'=>'原始語言','Original string'=>'原始字串','Paid'=>'付費','Partner'=>'合作夥伴','Please check that your site can be reached from the internet, then try again.'=>'請確認您的網站可從網際網路存取，然後再試一次。','Please choose a category for this report.'=>'請為此回報選擇類別。','Plugin'=>'外掛','Plugin · %s'=>'外掛 · %s','Plugins'=>'外掛','Preview'=>'預覽','Purchase restored. This site is now licensed.'=>'購買已還原,此網站現已取得授權。','Re-parsed entry count did not match the built index.'=>'重新解析的項目數量與建立的索引不符。','Re-verify'=>'重新驗證','Rebuild index now'=>'立即重建索引','Refusing to write outside the Babilim language-file directory.'=>'拒絕寫入 Babilim 語言檔目錄以外的位置。','Registration response was missing required fields.'=>'註冊回應缺少必要欄位。','Registration restarted.'=>'已重新開始註冊。','Remove'=>'移除','Remove everything Babilim installed'=>'移除 Babilim 安裝的所有內容','Remove everything Babilim installed? This deletes every language file it installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'確定要移除 Babilim 安裝的所有內容嗎？這會刪除 Babilim 為此網站上所有外掛與佈景主題安裝的每個語言檔案。','Remove the %2$s translation of %1$s from this site?'=>'要從此網站移除 %1$s 的 %2$s 翻譯嗎？','Removed %d installed component.'=>'已移除 %d 個已安裝的元件。','Removed after a failed integrity check'=>'完整性校驗失敗後已移除','Removed.'=>'已移除。','Removes every language file Babilim has installed for every plugin and theme on this site.'=>'移除 Babilim 為此網站上所有外掛與佈景主題安裝的每個語言檔案。','Report a problem'=>'回報問題','Report translation'=>'回報翻譯','Request newer translation'=>'申請較新的翻譯','Request translation'=>'申請翻譯','Requestable'=>'可申請','Requesting a translation puts this plugin or theme on one of the free service plan\'s slots for this site (the limit is %1$d for themes and %2$d for plugins), unless it already has one. A slot stays used, and a failed translation does not free it.'=>'申請翻譯會讓此外掛或佈景主題佔用本網站免費服務方案的一個名額(佈景主題上限為 %1$d 個,外掛上限為 %2$d 個),若已佔用則不會重複佔用。名額一經使用即保持佔用,翻譯失敗也不會釋出名額。','Requesting a translation puts this plugin or theme on one of the free service plan\'s slots for this site, unless it already has one. A slot stays used, and a failed translation does not free it.'=>'申請翻譯會讓此外掛或佈景主題佔用本網站免費服務方案的一個名額,若已佔用則不會重複佔用。名額一經使用即保持佔用,翻譯失敗也不會釋出名額。','Requesting…'=>'申請中…','Restart registration'=>'重新開始註冊','Restore code'=>'還原碼','Restore purchase'=>'還原購買','Retry request'=>'重試申請','Roll back'=>'回滾','Roll back and report'=>'回滾並回報','Roll back and send report'=>'回滾並送出回報','Roll back the %2$s translation of %1$s to the previous build?'=>'要將 %1$s 的 %2$s 翻譯回滾到上一個組建嗎？','Rolled back and reported.'=>'已回滾並回報。','Rolled back to the previous build.'=>'已回滾至先前的建置版本。','Rolled back, but the report could not be sent: %s'=>'已回滾，但無法送出回報：%s','Rolling back would overwrite \'%1$s\' (%2$s), which is now served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was changed.'=>'回滾將會覆寫「%1$s」（%2$s），該檔案目前已提供給另一個已安裝的元件（%3$s）使用，未變更任何內容。','Rotate-token response was missing site_token.'=>'輪換權杖的回應缺少 site_token。','Save changes'=>'儲存變更','Scheduled, waiting to be processed'=>'已排程，等待處理','Search'=>'搜尋','Search components'=>'搜尋元件','Search the installed translations'=>'搜尋已安裝的翻譯','Select all'=>'全選','Select fewer components: at most %1$d operations per run (you selected %2$d).'=>'請減少選取的元件：每次執行最多 %1$d 項操作（您已選取 %2$d 項）。','Send report'=>'送出回報','Service plan'=>'服務方案','Settings'=>'設定','Share error reports'=>'分享錯誤回報','Share this report'=>'分享此回報','Show a new restore code'=>'顯示新的還原碼','Show the "Report translation" entry in the admin toolbar'=>'在管理工具列中顯示「回報翻譯」項目','Some of this component\'s text is hard-coded by its author and can\'t be translated by a language pack.'=>'此元件的部分文字由作者寫死在程式中，無法透過語言包翻譯。','Status'=>'狀態','Status unknown'=>'狀態未知','String context'=>'字串語境','Suggested translation'=>'建議的翻譯','Supplementary translation index'=>'補充翻譯索引','Supplementary translation index rebuilt.'=>'已重建補充翻譯索引。','Supplementary translation maintenance'=>'補充翻譯維護','Supplementary translations'=>'補充翻譯','Sweep aborted without orphaning anything: %s.'=>'清理已中止，未將任何項目標為孤立：%s。','Sweep complete: %d file deleted.'=>'清理完成：已刪除 %d 個檔案。','Sweep now'=>'立即清理','Sync complete.'=>'同步完成。','Thank you. Your report was sent.'=>'謝謝您，已送出您的回報。','That component is not installed on this site, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'此元件尚未安裝在本網站上，因此無法為其申請翻譯。','That does not look like a restore code.'=>'這看起來不像還原碼。','That is not a valid WordPress locale code. Nothing was saved.'=>'這不是有效的 WordPress 語系代碼，未儲存任何內容。','That is not a valid build identifier.'=>'這不是有效的組建識別碼。','That upload screen was out of date: a different upload has been prepared since. Nothing was sent. Review the current one from the Translations list.'=>'該上傳畫面已過期:之後已準備了另一次上傳,因此未傳送任何內容。請從翻譯清單檢視目前的上傳內容。','The change could not be recorded in the translation index; please try again.'=>'無法將此變更記錄到翻譯索引中，請再試一次。','The cleanup ran, but some of its changes could not be recorded in the translation index; the next cleanup will retry them.'=>'清理已執行，但部分變更無法記錄到翻譯索引中；下次清理時會重試。','The component has no files that can be uploaded.'=>'此元件沒有可上傳的檔案。','The component is not inside the plugins or themes directory.'=>'此元件不在外掛或佈景主題目錄內。','The component\'s main file was not found.'=>'找不到元件的主檔案。','The download response was missing a usable location.'=>'下載回應缺少可用的位置。','The entry opens a panel to search the translations Babilim installed on this site and report one of them.'=>'此項目會開啟面板，可搜尋 Babilim 已在此網站安裝的翻譯，並回報其中一項。','The field "%1$s" is too long: it has %2$d characters and the limit is %3$d. Nothing was sent; please shorten it and try again.'=>'欄位「%1$s」過長：目前有 %2$d 個字元，上限為 %3$d 個。尚未傳送任何內容，請縮短後再試一次。','The free service plan gives each site a limited number of slots for plugins and themes; the slots in use are shown in Settings after you enable Babilim.'=>'免費服務方案為每個網站提供有限數量的外掛與佈景主題名額;啟用 Babilim 後,可在設定中查看已使用的名額。','The given domain \'%1$s\' matches neither the package manifest\'s own slug \'%2$s\' nor its text_domain \'%3$s\'.'=>'指定的網域「%1$s」與套件 manifest 本身的 slug「%2$s」及其 text_domain「%3$s」都不相符。','The merged index for \'%s\' was rebuilt, but the translation index could not record it; the next rebuild will retry.'=>'「%s」的合併索引已重建，但翻譯索引無法記錄；下次重建時會重試。','The original text and the translations made from it will be provided to other sites that install the same version.'=>'原文及據此產生的翻譯，將提供給其他安裝相同版本的網站。','The package declares no main translation file.'=>'此套件未宣告主要翻譯檔案。','The package has no %s for its own text domain.'=>'套件中沒有其自身文字網域的 %s。','The package manifest\'s kind \'%1$s\' does not match the requested kind \'%2$s\'.'=>'套件 manifest 的類型「%1$s」與請求的類型「%2$s」不符。','The package produced no servable main translation file.'=>'此套件未產生可供使用的主要翻譯檔案。','The package\'s text domain \'%1$s\' does not match this site\'s copy of the component (\'%2$s\'), so it was not installed.'=>'套件的文字網域「%1$s」與本網站的元件副本（「%2$s」）不符，因此未安裝。','The packaged component could not be read.'=>'無法讀取已封裝的元件。','The registration challenge is not in the expected form.'=>'註冊驗證挑戰的格式不符預期。','The report could not be sent.'=>'無法傳送回報。','The search could not be completed.'=>'無法完成搜尋。','The service asked this site to wait before syncing again.'=>'服務要求此網站在再次同步前先等待。','The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.'=>'服務無法連線到您的網站。可能是防火牆、安全性外掛或主機規則封鎖了請求，請允許對 /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge 的請求。','The service\'s upload offer was incomplete.'=>'服務提供的上傳資訊不完整。','The text domain \'%1$s\' (%2$s) is already served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was installed.'=>'文字網域「%1$s」（%2$s）已提供給另一個已安裝的元件（%3$s）使用，未安裝任何內容。','The upload is kept until you ask Babilim to delete it.'=>'上傳的內容會保留，直到您要求 Babilim 刪除為止。','Theme'=>'佈景主題','Theme · %s'=>'佈景主題 · %s','Themes'=>'佈景主題','There is no upload in progress.'=>'目前沒有進行中的上傳。','There is no upload waiting for confirmation.'=>'目前沒有等待確認的上傳。','These are the languages this site uses. You can change them in %s.'=>'這些是此網站使用的語言。您可以在 %s 中變更。','These fields will be sent:'=>'將會傳送以下欄位：','This build is not one this site currently knows about for this component/locale.'=>'本網站目前不認得此元件／語系的這個建置版本。','This component does not declare a version number, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'此元件未宣告版本號碼，因此無法為其申請翻譯。','This component is larger than the service accepts, so it cannot be uploaded.'=>'此元件超過服務可接受的大小，因此無法上傳。','This component was already uploaded. Babilim is checking it now.'=>'此元件已上傳，Babilim 正在檢查中。','This component\'s version number is longer than %d characters, which Babilim cannot handle, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'此元件的版本號碼超過 %d 個字元，Babilim 無法處理，因此無法為其申請翻譯。','This issues a new restore code and the previous one stops working. Continue?'=>'這會核發新的還原碼，先前的還原碼將失效。要繼續嗎？','This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in each site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'此網路的網站數量過多，無法逐一檢查，其中部分網站可能設定為在刪除外掛時清除其 Babilim 識別資訊。之後將無法自動還原綁定在這類網站的付費授權，您必須聯絡 Babilim 支援（%s）。若要保留識別資訊，請按「取消」，在各網站的 Babilim 設定中取消勾選「解除安裝時刪除所有 Babilim 資料」，然後再次停用。仍要停用嗎？','This plugin\'s own version, so the service can tell you to update it if it\'s too old to talk to.'=>'本外掛自身的版本，讓服務在版本過舊而無法通訊時，能通知您更新。','This report does not name a valid plugin or theme and locale.'=>'此回報未指明有效的外掛或佈景主題及語系。','This report does not name an installed string.'=>'此報告未指明任何已安裝的字串。','This report is missing a valid build to report against.'=>'此回報缺少可供回報的有效建置版本。','This report will be posted publicly on GitHub and may be kept by third parties.'=>'此回報將公開張貼在 GitHub 上，且可能被第三方保留。','This restore code was not recognised for this site.'=>'此還原碼無法對應到這個網站。','This site already has an active registration that can no longer be recovered automatically.'=>'此網站已有一個啟用中的註冊，但無法再自動復原。','This site has %1$d components across %2$d languages, which needs %3$d check batches; Babilim can handle at most %4$d per run. Reduce the managed languages in Settings or deactivate unused plugins and themes, then press Check again now.'=>'此網站有 %1$d 個元件、%2$d 種語言，需要 %3$d 個檢查批次；Babilim 每次執行最多可處理 %4$d 個。請在「設定」中減少管理的語言，或停用未使用的外掛與佈景主題，然後立即按下「重新檢查」。','This site has no purchase to show a code for.'=>'此網站沒有可顯示還原碼的購買紀錄。','This site is already licensed. Reload the page.'=>'此網站已取得授權。請重新載入頁面。','This site is not registered with Babilim yet.'=>'此網站尚未在 Babilim 註冊。','This site is over the size the service accepts in one sync, so some items were left out: %1$d components and %2$d locales.'=>'本網站超出服務單次同步可接受的大小，因此部分項目被略過：%1$d 個元件與 %2$d 個語系。','This site is part of a multisite network, which does not install new translations automatically. Translations that are already installed are still updated.'=>'此網站屬於多站網路，不會自動安裝新的翻譯。已安裝的翻譯仍會持續更新。','This site is verified.'=>'本網站已通過驗證。','This site must be verified first.'=>'必須先驗證此網站。','This site\'s URL, so the service can verify you own it.'=>'本網站的網址，讓服務能驗證您擁有這個網站。','This site\'s address is too long for Babilim to register.'=>'此網站的網址過長，Babilim 無法註冊。','This site\'s configured locale.'=>'本網站設定的語系。','This site\'s locale code is not one Babilim can register.'=>'此網站的語系代碼不是 Babilim 可以註冊的代碼。','This string can\'t be reported from this site.'=>'無法從此網站回報這個字串。','This string is not among the translations installed on this site. Search again and pick it from the list.'=>'此字串不在本網站已安裝的翻譯中。請重新搜尋,並從清單中選取。','This translation was updated since you searched. Search again and pick the string from the new list.'=>'此翻譯在您搜尋後已更新。請重新搜尋,並從新的清單中選取該字串。','To translate this component, Babilim needs its source.'=>'若要翻譯此元件，Babilim 需要取得其原始碼。','Too many attempts. Try again tomorrow.'=>'嘗試次數過多,請明天再試。','Too many reports today. Try again tomorrow.'=>'今天的回報次數過多，請明天再試。','Too many requests.'=>'請求次數過多。','Toolbar'=>'工具列','Translating…'=>'翻譯中…','Translation does not load'=>'翻譯無法載入','Translation failed'=>'翻譯失敗','Translation files you put in %s always take priority over Babilim\'s. They are kept unless you uncheck this.'=>'您放在 %s 的翻譯檔案一律優先於 Babilim 的翻譯。除非取消勾選此項，否則這些檔案會被保留。','Translation requested.'=>'已申請翻譯。','Translations'=>'翻譯','Type'=>'類型','Type at least 2 characters to search.'=>'請至少輸入 2 個字元以進行搜尋。','Unexpected HTTP %d response.'=>'非預期的 HTTP %d 回應。','Uninstall'=>'解除安裝','Unknown kind: %s'=>'未知的類型：%s','Unsafe domain: %s'=>'不安全的文字領域：%s','Unsafe locale: %s'=>'不安全的語系：%s','Unsafe slug: %s'=>'不安全的 slug：%s','Unsafe text_domain: %s'=>'不安全的 text_domain：%s','Update'=>'更新','Update available'=>'有可用更新','Updates'=>'更新','Updating…'=>'更新中…','Upgrade this site'=>'升級此網站','Upload and request'=>'上傳並申請','Upload cancelled.'=>'已取消上傳。','Upload complete — translation requested.'=>'上傳完成，已申請翻譯。','Upload expired before it finished'=>'上傳在完成前已過期','Upload in progress — continue or cancel'=>'上傳進行中 — 繼續或取消','Upload this component?'=>'要上傳此元件嗎？','Upload was not accepted'=>'上傳未被接受','Uploading'=>'正在上傳','Uploading part %1$d of %2$d…'=>'正在上傳第 %1$d 部分，共 %2$d 部分…','Uploading…'=>'正在上傳…','Verified'=>'已驗證','Verify response was missing site_token.'=>'驗證回應缺少 site_token。','Version %s'=>'版本 %s','What is sent when you enable Babilim'=>'啟用 Babilim 時會傳送的資料','When something fails inside Babilim, send an error report to the Babilim service so it can be published as a public issue on GitHub. The report is sent as coming from this site, with the same authentication as every other request to the Babilim service. The service publishes only the error code and versions as a public issue on GitHub; the public issue contains no site address, content or file paths. Off by default.'=>'當 Babilim 內部發生失敗時，將錯誤回報傳送至 Babilim 服務，以便在 GitHub 上公開為議題。回報會以來自此網站的身分傳送，驗證方式與傳送給 Babilim 服務的其他所有請求相同。該服務只會將錯誤代碼與版本在 GitHub 上公開為議題；公開議題不包含網站位址、內容或檔案路徑。預設為關閉。','Where you saw this (optional)'=>'您在哪裡看到的（選填）','While this is on, translations the service lists as available for the languages you manage are installed during the twice-daily sync.'=>'開啟後，服務列為可用、且屬於您所管理語言的翻譯，會在每日兩次同步時安裝。','WordPress.org'=>'WordPress.org','Wrong for this context'=>'不適用於此語境','Wrong meaning'=>'語意錯誤','Wrong plural form'=>'複數形式錯誤','Wrong term'=>'術語錯誤','Yes'=>'是','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'您沒有權限執行此操作。','Your PHP version, for compatibility.'=>'您的 PHP 版本，用於確認相容性。','Your WordPress version, to serve compatible translation files.'=>'您的 WordPress 版本，用於提供相容的翻譯檔案。','Your new restore code: %s. Keep it somewhere safe — the previous code no longer works.'=>'您的新還原碼：%s。請妥善保存，先前的還原碼已失效。','Your report is processed automatically by AI models and may improve this translation for other sites.'=>'您的回報會由 AI 模型自動處理，並可能改善其他網站上的這項翻譯。','Your site answered, but not with what was expected. The REST API may be rewritten by another plugin, or that endpoint may be cached; please exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting.'=>'您的網站有回應，但內容不符預期。REST API 可能被其他外掛改寫，或該端點遭到快取；請將 /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge 排除在快取與改寫之外。','Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded.'=>'您的網站回應時間過長。請稍後再試，並檢查主機是否過慢或負載過高。','Zip has no manifest.json.'=>'zip 中沒有 manifest.json。','Zip is missing expected default file: %s'=>'ZIP 檔缺少預期的預設檔案：%s','Zip is missing expected file: %s'=>'ZIP 檔缺少預期的檔案：%s','_manifest.json has an unexpected structure'=>'_manifest.json 的結構不符預期','could not read _manifest.json: %s'=>'無法讀取 _manifest.json：%s','expected_manifest is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'expected_manifest 缺少或含有無效的「%s」。','expected_manifest\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'expected_manifest 的 \'server_build_id\' 不是有效的建置 ID。','failed to parse _manifest.json: %s'=>'無法解析 _manifest.json：%s','it would orphan %1$d of %2$d managed components (more than half)'=>'這會使 %2$d 個受管理的元件中的 %1$d 個變成孤立（超過半數）','it would orphan every managed %1$s component (%2$d of %2$d)'=>'這會使所有受管理的%1$s元件變成孤立（共 %2$d 個中的 %2$d 個）','l10n.php entry count mismatch for %s'=>'%s 的 l10n.php 項目數量不符','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_entries\'.'=>'manifest.json 的「default_domain_entries」無效。','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_files\'.'=>'manifest.json 的 \'default_domain_files\' 無效。','manifest.json in the zip is not valid JSON.'=>'zip 中的 manifest.json 不是有效的 JSON。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'manifest.json 缺少「%s」，或該欄位無效。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'build_no\'.'=>'manifest.json 缺少「build_no」，或該欄位無效。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'entries\'.'=>'manifest.json 缺少「entries」，或該欄位無效。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'extra_domains\'.'=>'manifest.json 缺少「extra_domains」，或該欄位無效。','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'files\'.'=>'manifest.json 缺少「files」，或該欄位無效。','manifest.json\'s \'%s\' does not match the expected value.'=>'manifest.json 的「%s」與預期值不符。','manifest.json\'s \'contract\' is not a valid version string.'=>'manifest.json 的「contract」不是有效的版本字串。','manifest.json\'s \'kind\' must be \'plugin\' or \'theme\'.'=>'manifest.json 的 \'kind\' 必須是 \'plugin\' 或 \'theme\'。','manifest.json\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'manifest.json 的「server_build_id」不是有效的組建識別碼。','manifest.json\'s \'status\' must be \'published\'.'=>'manifest.json 的「status」必須為「published」。','nonce must be a hexadecimal string.'=>'nonce 必須是十六進位字串。','per day'=>'每日','rc_…'=>'rc_…','sha256 mismatch for %s'=>'%s 的 sha256 不符','sha256 mismatch for default/%s'=>'default/%s 的 sha256 不符','component kind in the sweep brake messageplugin'=>'外掛','component kind in the sweep brake messagetheme'=>'佈景主題','problem report categoryOther'=>'其他','translation statusAvailable'=>'可用','translation statusInstalled'=>'已安裝']];